{"task_id": "Mbpp/6", "solution": "def _count_set_bits(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts the number of set bits (1s) in an integer.\"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    while n > 0:\n        n &= (n - 1)\n        count += 1\n    return count\n\ndef differ_At_One_Bit_Pos(num1: int, num2: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks whether two numbers differ at exactly one bit position.\n    It computes the XOR of the numbers and counts the set bits in the result.\n    \"\"\"\n    xor_result = num1 ^ num2\n    return _count_set_bits(xor_result) == 1"}
