{"task_id": "Mbpp/126", "solution": "def find_divisors(number: int) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"Finds all positive divisors of a given integer.\"\"\"\n    divisors = []\n    for i in range(1, int(number**0.5) + 1):\n        if number % i == 0:\n            divisors.append(i)\n            if i * i != number:\n                divisors.append(number // i)\n    return sorted(divisors)\n\ndef find_common_divisors(divisors1: list[int], divisors2: list[int]) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"Identifies common elements between two lists of divisors.\"\"\"\n    set1 = set(divisors1)\n    common = [d for d in divisors2 if d in set1]\n    return sorted(common)\n\ndef sum_common_divisors(num1: int, num2: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of common divisors for two given numbers.\"\"\"\n    divs1 = find_divisors(num1)\n    divs2 = find_divisors(num2)\n    common = find_common_divisors(divs1, divs2)\n    return sum(common)"}
