{"task_id": "Mbpp/223", "solution": "def is_majority(array: list, n: int, element: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given element is a majority element in the sorted array.\n    A majority element occurs more than n/2 times.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _validate_input(arr: list, length: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Validates input array and its length for processing.\"\"\"\n        return length > 0 and len(arr) == length\n\n    def _find_first_occurrence(arr: list, target: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Finds the index of the first occurrence of the target using binary search.\"\"\"\n        low, high = 0, len(arr) - 1\n        first_index = -1\n        while low <= high:\n            mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n            if arr[mid] == target:\n                first_index = mid\n                high = mid - 1  # Try to find an earlier occurrence\n            elif arr[mid] < target:\n                low = mid + 1\n            else:\n                high = mid - 1\n        return first_index\n\n    def _find_last_occurrence(arr: list, target: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Finds the index of the last occurrence of the target using binary search.\"\"\"\n        low, high = 0, len(arr) - 1\n        last_index = -1\n        while low <= high:\n            mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n            if arr[mid] == target:\n                last_index = mid\n                low = mid + 1  # Try to find a later occurrence\n            elif arr[mid] < target:\n                low = mid + 1\n            else:\n                high = mid - 1\n        return last_index\n\n    if not _validate_input(array, n):\n        return False\n\n    first_index = _find_first_occurrence(array, element)\n\n    if first_index == -1:\n        return False  # Element not found in the array\n\n    last_index = _find_last_occurrence(array, element)\n\n    occurrence_count = last_index - first_index + 1\n\n    return occurrence_count > n / 2"}
