{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the average of cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n    Assumes n is a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    # The sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers is given by [n * (n + 1) / 2]^2\n    sum_of_cubes = (n * (n + 1) // 2) ** 2\n    # The average is the sum of cubes divided by n\n    average = sum_of_cubes / n\n    return average"}
