{"task_id": "Mbpp/462", "solution": "def combinations_list(input_list: list) -> list[list]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Generates all possible combinations (powerset) of elements from the input list,\n    maintaining a specific order as demonstrated in the examples.\n    \"\"\"\n    combinations = [[]]\n    for element in input_list:\n        # For each existing combination, create a new one by adding the current element\n        # prepended to the existing combinations.\n        new_combinations_for_element = []\n        for current_combo in combinations:\n            new_combinations_for_element.append([element] + current_combo)\n        combinations.extend(new_combinations_for_element)\n    return combinations"}
