{"task_id": "Mbpp/566", "solution": "def sum_digits(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the digits of a non-negative integer.\n\n    This function processes the number mathematically to extract and sum its digits.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Design context specifies input validation and error handling, but the prompt\n    # says \"Do NOT add isinstance() checks or raise exceptions for edge cases\"\n    # Assuming valid non-negative integer input as per prompt constraint.\n    \n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    digit_sum = 0\n    while n > 0:\n        digit_sum += n % 10  # Extract the last digit\n        n //= 10             # Remove the last digit\n    return digit_sum"}
