{"task_id": "Mbpp/605", "solution": "def prime_num(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given integer n is a prime number.\n    Handles edge cases for numbers less than or equal to 1, and the number 2.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 1:\n        return False\n    if n == 2:\n        return True\n    if n % 2 == 0:\n        return False\n    \n    # Check for divisors from 3 up to the square root of n, incrementing by 2\n    i = 3\n    while i * i <= n:\n        if n % i == 0:\n            return False\n        i += 2\n            \n    return True"}
