{"task_id": "Mbpp/616", "solution": "def tuple_modulo(tuple1, tuple2):\n    \"\"\"\n    Performs element-wise modulo on two tuples of the same length.\n    Raises ValueError for length mismatch or ZeroDivisionError for division by zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(tuple1) != len(tuple2):\n        raise ValueError(\"Input tuples must have the same length.\")\n\n    results = []\n    for i in range(len(tuple1)):\n        dividend = tuple1[i]\n        divisor = tuple2[i]\n\n        if divisor == 0:\n            raise ZeroDivisionError(\"Division by zero in modulo operation.\")\n\n        results.append(dividend % divisor)\n\n    return tuple(results)"}
