{"task_id": "Mbpp/630", "solution": "def get_coordinates(coord_tuple: tuple) -> list[list[int]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Extract all adjacent coordinates in a 3x3 grid pattern.\n\n    Args:\n        coord_tuple: Input coordinate as (x, y) tuple\n\n    Returns:\n        List of coordinate pairs as [x, y] lists in row-major order\n    \"\"\"\n    x, y = coord_tuple\n    result = []\n    # Generate offsets for a 3x3 grid in row-major order\n    # from top-left (-1,-1) to bottom-right (1,1)\n    for dx in range(-1, 2):\n        for dy in range(-1, 2):\n            result.append([x + dx, y + dy])\n    return result"}
