{"task_id": "Mbpp/763", "solution": "def find_min_diff(array, length):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the minimum absolute difference between any two elements in a given array.\n    It iterates through all possible pairs to find the smallest difference.\n    \"\"\"\n    min_diff = float('inf')\n\n    for i in range(length):\n        for j in range(i + 1, length):\n            current_diff = abs(array[i] - array[j])\n            if current_diff < min_diff:\n                min_diff = current_diff\n    return min_diff"}
