{"task_id": "Mbpp/767", "solution": "def get_pairs_count(numbers: list, target_sum: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts pairs of numbers from a list whose sum equals a specified target value.\n    Each occurrence of a duplicate value is treated as a separate element.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    n = len(numbers)\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if numbers[i] + numbers[j] == target_sum:\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/769", "solution": "def Diff(first_list: list, second_list: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculate difference between two lists preserving order.\n\n    Args:\n        first_list: List of integers to filter\n        second_list: List of integers to exclude\n\n    Returns:\n        List containing elements from first_list not in second_list\n    \"\"\"\n    result = []\n    second_set = set(second_list)\n    for item in first_list:\n        if item not in second_set:\n            result.append(item)\n    return result"}
