{"task_id": "Mbpp/799", "solution": "def left_rotate(number: int, d: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Rotates the bits of a 32-bit number to the left by d positions.\n    The rotation handles wraparound for bits shifted beyond the 32-bit boundary.\n    \"\"\"\n    BITS = 32\n    # Ensure d is within the range [0, BITS-1]\n    d %= BITS\n\n    # Perform left rotation\n    # (number << d) shifts bits to the left\n    # (number >> (BITS - d)) wraps around the bits shifted out from the left\n    return ((number << d) | (number >> (BITS - d))) & ((1 << BITS) - 1)"}
